{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Lumora 把 iPhone 相簿變成可上下滑動的動態牆，讓你在重溫影片與照片的同時整理重複項目；適合想輕鬆回看舊回憶、減少相簿雜亂及騰出儲存空間的用戶。原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-168.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>重溫與清理一氣呵成</h2>\n<p>Lumora 把相簿變成可上下滑動的動態牆，影片與照片連續播放，長按可加速、雙擊讚好，同時段照片會自動組成貼文。你可每日重看往年今日，並以滑動卡片刪除、保留或收藏；系統會找出重複、相似、模糊與大型影片，保留最佳版本並壓縮影片。所有處理均在本機完成，可離線使用及以 Face ID 鎖定。</p>\n<figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1290x2796bb-24-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1181\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1290x2796bb-25-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1181\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1290x2796bb-26-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1181\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1290x2796bb-27-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1181\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1290x2796bb-28-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1181\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1290x2796bb-29-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1181\"/></figure>\n</figure>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Lumora: Photo Cleaner &amp; Feed</li>\n<li>應用類別：Photo &amp; Video</li>\n<li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/lumora-photo-cleaner-feed/id6825000420?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li>\n</ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T22:04:18.234923+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":322,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T21:43:15+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T22:22:29.695945+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T21:57:50.945148+00:00","content_hash":"b6c1bd5beabef83de2a32c64e025f2f730b504c16cc088e3af2de763523479ff","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}